# 基本文章編集の表示のメニュー: the desktop's own and the process show the same page in each
# view (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. A copy of 基本文章編集 with 30 paragraphs (mkbig
# doc 30) with the caret in its second paragraph, shown 詳細, 原稿 and 清書 again by the
# items of 表示 in the menu opened at 300,250; the shots (doc_view_k_*, doc_view_p_*) are
# compared afterwards inside the window, where the text is (101,125 to 682,482). Saved after,
# record 0 of both is the same as it was. The menu opens with the item chosen last on the
# pointer's row (表示 60 below 閉じる); 表示's own opens with its first row (原稿) on 表示's row,
# 詳細 20 and 清書 40 below. While the desktop's menu is open the desktop answers no sync.
# Before each shot the caret is put again where it is (300,170 in 詳細, the head of the
# text at 111,135 in 原稿 and 清書): the caret's turn to blink is counted again from that
# press in both, so that both show it (the desktop counts it from the press that opened
# the menu, the process from the press that chose the item).
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
mkbig doc 30
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
click 300 170
sync 600
click 300 250 1
wait 400
wait 400
move 330 310
wait 300
move 440 310
wait 400
move 440 330
wait 300
click 440 330
sync 600
click 300 170
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_view_k_detail
click 300 250 1
wait 400
wait 400
move 330 250
wait 300
move 440 250
wait 400
move 440 250
wait 300
click 440 250
sync 600
click 111 135
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_view_k_xml
click 300 250 1
wait 400
wait 400
move 330 250
wait 300
move 440 250
wait 400
move 440 290
wait 300
click 440 290
sync 600
click 111 135
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_view_k_clean
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
logmark
click 300 170
expectsince document: drew
logmark
click 300 250 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 400
move 330 250
wait 300
move 440 250
wait 400
move 440 270
wait 300
click 440 270
expectsince document: command view.detail
expectsince document: drew
logmark
click 300 170
expectsince document: drew
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_view_p_detail
logmark
click 300 250 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 400
move 330 250
wait 300
move 440 250
wait 400
move 440 250
wait 300
click 440 250
expectsince document: command view.xml
expectsince document: drew
logmark
click 111 135
expectsince document: drew
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_view_p_xml
logmark
click 300 250 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 400
move 330 250
wait 300
move 440 250
wait 400
move 440 290
wait 300
click 440 290
expectsince document: command view.clean
expectsince document: drew
logmark
click 111 135
expectsince document: drew
move 690 490
wait 300
